    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      550.55,
      298.32,
      646.02
    ],
    "text": "The boundaries to the land portions with undermentioned names and extents depicted in the Surveyor General\u2019s advance tracing bearing No. R/GDK/2021/459 dated 2023.11.23 situated in the Village called Rakwana (F.V.P. 699) in the Grama Niladari Division No. 231/C, Rakwana South in Atakalan Korale Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Godakawela, in Ratnapura District, Sabaragamuwa Province:",
